# CGC project — Iron Law compliance
# ====================================
# 1. ZERO FREE PARAMETERS
#    The CGC engine classifies diagrams by kinematics and topology only.
#    No physics constants, no experimental inputs, no fitted parameters.
#
# 2. FACTUAL HONESTY
#    All placeholder code marked with `# PLACEHOLDER` / `# TODO`.
#    All approximations explicitly documented.
#
# 3. STRICT RIGOR
#    Each module has independent tests with physics benchmarks.
#    Run: python scripts/cgc-dev verify --level=4
#
# 4. NO DECEPTIVE IMPLEMENTATION
#    No hardcoded experimental values. No forged audit reports.
#    All values dynamically computed or explicitly marked as TODO.
